    <item>
      <title>Version 0.5.0 alpha (Build 1009)</title><link>https://nsloon.app</link>
      <sparkle:version>1009</sparkle:version><sparkle:shortVersionString>0.5.0(1009)</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:releaseNotesLink>https://nsloon.app/Loon4Mac/changelog.html#build-1009</sparkle:releaseNotesLink>
      <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://nsloon.app/Loon4Mac/changelog.html</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>新增网关功能，具体功能和教程见：https://nsloon.app/blog/loon4mac-gateway</li><li>新增 DHCP 功能，具体功能和教程见：https://nsloon.app/blog/loon4mac-dhcp</li><li>优化进程规则，加入更多匹配方式，具体见：https://nsloon.app/docs/Rule/process_rule</li><li>性能优化，最新版本在m1 max macbook 上的回环测试为：单流上传12G，单流下载 14G，具体测试结果和测试方式见：https://nsloon.app/blog/loon4mac-tcp-performance</li><li>优化首页布局显示</li><li>合并最新版 iOS 功能</li></ul>]]></description>
